   5. Commercial Use Limitation.

      (a) Below the Threshold. You may make Commercial Use of the Work,
          Derivative Works and Output under this License for as long as
          Your Attributable Revenue has not exceeded the Threshold.

      (b) Above the Threshold. If Your Attributable Revenue exceeds the
          Threshold, You must tell Fixed Seed in writing within thirty (30)
          days, at support@fixedseed.com or at another address Fixed Seed
          publishes for this purpose, so that You and Fixed Seed can discuss
          a separate commercial license. Your Commercial Use may continue
          under this License for ninety (90) days after Your Attributable
          Revenue first exceeded the Threshold, while You and Fixed Seed
          negotiate in good faith. After that, this License grants You no
          rights for Commercial Use, and Commercial Use requires a separate
          written agreement with Fixed Seed. Fixed Seed may extend that
          period in writing.

      (c) Other use. Use that is not Commercial Use, such as personal use,
          research, education and evaluation, is not limited by this
          Section, whatever Your revenue.

      (d) Good faith. If Fixed Seed asks in writing, You will tell Fixed
          Seed in good faith whether Your Attributable Revenue has
          exceeded the Threshold.

